flowchart TD
  A[Owner's source V3 NFT] --> B[Validate owner, signature, deadline and nonce]
  B --> C[Read Registry executor / asset guards]
  C --> D[Decrease liquidity and collect tokens]
  D --> E[Burn source position]
  E --> F{Signed intent requests one-hop rebalance?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Execute bounded swap through configured router]
  F -->|No| H[Keep collected token pair]
  G --> I[Mint new V3 position to original owner]
  H --> I
  I --> J[Refund defined residual balances; emit event]
  C -. guard fails .-> R[Revert whole transaction]
  D -. late external-call failure .-> R
  G -. swap or slippage failure .-> R
  I -. mint failure .-> R
  R --> Z[State changes in that transaction roll back]
  MOCK[Local suite uses deterministic mocks] -. testing environment .-> D
  style R fill:#f7e8e4,stroke:#9b352a
  style MOCK fill:#f0ebf1,stroke:#6a596f
